
Ampero Firmware Release Note

https://res.hotoneaudio.com/prod/support/Ampero%20Firmware%20V4.2.1730094868412.zip

Version 4.2
Released 9/30/2024

This V4.2 firmware update brings you new effects, more powerful features, optimized system performance and bug fixes. We recommend all users to execute this update for the best possible user experience.

IMPORTANT – RE-CALIBRATE BOTH BUILT-IN/EXTERNAL EXPRESSION PEDALS AFTER UPDATE (CTRL/EXP > EXP 1/2 Settings  > Calibrate). 
After this update, the original CTRL data will be moved to the CTRL 1 position, so please reset it as needed.
Use V4.2 firmware with Ampero Editor V1.4.2 ONLY. 

New Features 

1.	Added the function of dragging module position. You can drag the module to the position you want in the editing interface
2.	Added volume pedal pre/post function (TEMPO/VOLUME module - Vol Position), now you can choose to put the volume pedal pre/post
3.	Added CTRL control, now you can set all 4 footswitches to CTRL（After this update, the original CTRL data will be moved to CTRL 1 position）
4.	Added touch control for parameter bar. You can click on the left and right sides of the parameter bar to increase or decrease or switch the selected parameter
5.	Classic PS – CDCM HD pitch model available in FX1/FX2/FX3 modules, based on Whammy®*
6.	Tweed Prince – CDCM HD amp model available in AMP module, based on Fender® Tweed Princeton* (5F2-A version)
7.	Black Prince – CDCM HD amp model available in AMP module, based on Fender® Blackface Princeton®* (AA964 version)
8.	2290 Mod – CDCM HD delay model available in DLY module, based on TC Electronic® 2290 Dynamic Digital Delay*


*The mentioned manufacturers and product names are trademarks or registered trademarks of the respective owners. The trademarks were used merely to identify the sound character of this product. 


Improvements, Changes & Bug Fixes

1.	Other minor bug fixes



